  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mn>2</mn></math> planes are being contained by the vectors <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>.</mo></math> If the angle between these <math><mn>2</mn></math> planes is <math><mi>&#952;</mi></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></math> is equal to",
